## 1. Executive Summary

TripMate is a collaborative trip-planning platform. Two major phases extend it beyond static itinerary storage into an intelligent, location-aware planning tool:

| Phase | What it adds | Powered by |
|---|---|---|
| **Phase 6 — AI Trip Planner** | Auto-generates a structured, day-wise itinerary from trip details | Google Gemini API |
| **Phase 7 — Map Integration** | Interactive map with destination + nearby-place search | Geoapify + Leaflet |

> **In short:** Phase 6 tells the user *what to do*. Phase 7 shows them *where it is*. Together they turn TripMate into an AI + geospatial planning assistant.

