## 3. System Architecture

Both phases follow the **same backend-proxy pattern**: the frontend never talks to a third-party API directly.

```
React Frontend  →  Express Backend  →  Third-Party API
  (axios)          (controller)         (Gemini / Geoapify)
```

**Why this matters:** API keys stay server-side only, requests can be authenticated/validated first, and results can be cached or shaped before reaching the client.

