## 8. Summary

**Phase 6** adds AI-powered itinerary generation via the **Google Gemini API** — day-wise planning, budget estimation, hotel/food recommendations, packing checklist, travel tips, and safety notes, all cached in MongoDB and regenerable on demand.

**Phase 7** adds an interactive map via **Geoapify + Leaflet** — destination visualization, category-based nearby-place search, geolocation, and dynamic markers.

Together, these phases combine AI-generated planning with real-world geospatial data, making TripMate a complete, intelligent, collaborative trip-planning platform.

